# Griz HQ redesign

This version replaces the small bear emoji with a custom CSS paw and a script-style "Griz" wordmark.

Upload/replace `index.html` and `styles.css` in the root of the GitHub repository.

This is a fan-built design and does not use the official University of Montana logo artwork.

